        "content": "{\"original_question\": \"I'm planning a weekend getaway and want to try something creatively fulfilling. What would you suggest?\", \"subquestion\": \"What are the user's past creative activities or hobbies?\", \"node_id\": \"user_creative_history\", \"planned_parent_ids\": [], \"supported_parents\": [], \"prior_state\": {\"id\": \"user_creative_history\", \"answer\": null, \"status\": \"unknown\", \"version\": 0, \"planned_parent_ids\": [], \"alternatives\": [], \"unresolved_inputs\": [], \"unresolved_guards\": [], \"partial_span_ids\": [], \"omitted_alternative_count\": 0, \"established_in_view\": false}, \"known_conflicts\": [], \"refinement_available\": true, \"condition_audit_enabled\": true, \"evidence\": [{\"node_id\": \"user_creative_history\", \"kind\": \"explicit\", \"stance\": \"support\", \"claim\": \"The user reflects on music documentaries and the artistic process, indicating an interest in music and creative expression.\", \"entity_scope\": \"user\", \"event_time\": null, \"reason\": \"The user describes feeling unsatisfied with a film that skimmed over music's intricacies and focused on celebrity interviews, showing engagement with music as a creative subject.\", \"source_ids\": [\"src_00d2ac33708aab6cb9861782\"], \"time_source_ids\": [], \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:e7a026a1e699694225904ac735e54f242d28ca85da0c2e3ea86daf04d7e3237a\", \"id\": \"e1\", \"assessment_id\": \"ev_5233462a9c6dd7ec7ea282a7\", \"fragments\": [{\"source_role\": \"user\", \"source_message_indices\": [43], \"premise_group_ids\": [\"prem_b50cf609562c938a501fadad\", \"prem_3631c3415a3cb4cd805b9990\", \"prem_bfd3d02b5c5e678e96cc7bfc\"], \"source_alias\": \"s3\", \"id\": \"src_00d2ac33708aab6cb9861782\", \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:e7a026a1e699694225904ac735e54f242d28ca85da0c2e3ea86daf04d7e3237a\", \"start\": 105, \"end\": 478, \"exact_quote\": \"User: I left feeling unsatisfied, as though the film skimmed over the intricacies that make music a universal language. It was almost as if they focused too much on celebrity interviews and not enough on the artistic process itself. I found myself reflecting on how music has the power to unite diverse cultures and express emotions that words alone often fail to capture. \", \"raw_text_hash\": \"0273aee06a4f88db3e70585717f79f993f879589f854ee93d87eda70c828e9de\", \"event_time\": null}], \"node_ids\": [\"user_creative_history\"], \"raw_text_hash\": \"0273aee06a4f88db3e70585717f79f993f879589f854ee93d87eda70c828e9de\", \"source_role\": \"user\", \"source_message_indices\": [43], \"premise_group_ids\": [\"prem_3631c3415a3cb4cd805b9990\", \"prem_b50cf609562c938a501fadad\", \"prem_bfd3d02b5c5e678e96cc7bfc\"], \"time_fragments\": [], \"start\": 105, \"end\": 478, \"exact_quote\": \"User: I left feeling unsatisfied, as though the film skimmed over the intricacies that make music a universal language. It was almost as if they focused too much on celebrity interviews and not enough on the artistic process itself. I found myself reflecting on how music has the power to unite diverse cultures and express emotions that words alone often fail to capture. \"}, {\"node_id\": \"user_creative_history\", \"kind\": \"explicit\", \"stance\": \"support\", \"claim\": \"The user attended a hands-on workshop on integrating traditional sounds with digital techniques and is now enrolled in an audio production workshop.\", \"entity_scope\": \"user\", \"event_time\": null, \"reason\": \"The user explicitly states attending a workshop and enrolling in an audio production course, indicating past and current creative activities.\", \"source_ids\": [\"src_30821d29f827b23f4eed4982\"], \"time_source_ids\": [], \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:2e3781c45289036c9cb65ab4a01320b0762e67e335720ff5459ae18689577ee9\", \"id\": \"e3\", \"assessment_id\": \"ev_26a2b40f0eeb9eb6f4bca942\", \"fragments\": [{\"source_role\": \"user\", \"source_message_indices\": [70, 71], \"premise_group_ids\": [\"prem_7585363ba2c6de2e3874c3c5\", \"prem_e3de249e6c39d4c8c8b4aec0\", \"prem_45d0adc1b8f408a04ce86906\"], \"source_alias\": \"s12\", \"id\": \"src_30821d29f827b23f4eed4982\", \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:2e3781c45289036c9cb65ab4a01320b0762e67e335720ff5459ae18689577ee9\", \"start\": 105, \"end\": 388, \"exact_quote\": \"User: Absolutely! After attending a hands-on workshop focused on integrating traditional sounds with digital techniques, I’m now enrolled in an audio production workshop. The workshop was eye-opening, providing insights into how to use technology to enhance traditional music forms. \", \"raw_text_hash\": \"30268a8fff528709c537f62907a4af2495488fddbd24b131fb7ad281f4741fcc\", \"event_time\": null}], \"node_ids\": [\"user_creative_history\"], \"raw_text_hash\": \"30268a8fff528709c537f62907a4af2495488fddbd24b131fb7ad281f4741fcc\", \"source_role\": \"user\", \"source_message_indices\": [70, 71], \"premise_group_ids\": [\"prem_45d0adc1b8f408a04ce86906\", \"prem_7585363ba2c6de2e3874c3c5\", \"prem_e3de249e6c39d4c8c8b4aec0\"], \"time_fragments\": [], \"start\": 105, \"end\": 388, \"exact_quote\": \"User: Absolutely! After attending a hands-on workshop focused on integrating traditional sounds with digital techniques, I’m now enrolled in an audio production workshop. The workshop was eye-opening, providing insights into how to use technology to enhance traditional music forms. \"}, {\"node_id\": \"user_creative_history\", \"kind\": \"explicit\", \"stance\": \"support\", \"claim\": \"The user announced a hiatus from remixing to concentrate on original compositions and personal projects.\", \"entity_scope\": \"user\", \"event_time\": null, \"reason\": \"The user explicitly states they announced a hiatus from remixing to focus on original compositions and personal projects.\", \"source_ids\": [\"src_c6cf9542441762b71f7ac79e\"], \"time_source_ids\": [], \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:6d150ad4c535a7d1e56c49b3ef96bb96c6ad1180a0c11c38c79fd844a3c7550b\", \"id\": \"e7\", \"assessment_id\": \"ev_6f6