emory:9dcc68cdc78aba6361e81893cb4c75797dcbb4404284522da9916f036582c37f\", \"id\": \"e12\", \"assessment_id\": \"ev_4647d6269622c021a4af385c\", \"fragments\": [{\"source_role\": \"user\", \"source_message_indices\": [159], \"premise_group_ids\": [\"prem_06268164f4d04fc896aa68c6\", \"prem_601622b6ac479277b8904844\"], \"source_alias\": \"s35\", \"id\": \"src_78b57eb5c1c437ee760d961a\", \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:9dcc68cdc78aba6361e81893cb4c75797dcbb4404284522da9916f036582c37f\", \"start\": 107, \"end\": 356, \"exact_quote\": \"User: After several disagreements over the artistic direction, I felt stifled, which really discouraged me from that collaborative process. It was as if the creative vision I had in mind was at odds with the direction my bandmates wanted to pursue. \", \"raw_text_hash\": \"1057f15d0a1709e036e10a4330ce43442ba36c98ccfeb02d1e90e6ac2c2b17f9\", \"event_time\": null}], \"node_ids\": [\"user_creative_history\"], \"raw_text_hash\": \"1057f15d0a1709e036e10a4330ce43442ba36c98ccfeb02d1e90e6ac2c2b17f9\", \"source_role\": \"user\", \"source_message_indices\": [159], \"premise_group_ids\": [\"prem_06268164f4d04fc896aa68c6\", \"prem_601622b6ac479277b8904844\"], \"time_fragments\": [], \"start\": 107, \"end\": 356, \"exact_quote\": \"User: After several disagreements over the artistic direction, I felt stifled, which really discouraged me from that collaborative process. It was as if the creative vision I had in mind was at odds with the direction my bandmates wanted to pursue. \"}, {\"node_id\": \"user_creative_history\", \"kind\": \"explicit\", \"stance\": \"support\", \"claim\": \"The user explored audio production techniques but found it did not resonate and preferred experiencing music over technical details.\", \"entity_scope\": \"user\", \"event_time\": null, \"reason\": \"The user states they explored audio production but it didn't resonate, indicating a past creative activity and a preference.\", \"source_ids\": [\"src_cdbcccf5a7334b6a4f8c271d\"], \"time_source_ids\": [], \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:2cb1946568c5490c5a3ee4bdb9c2a51d2485f16543f002ab190bad74ea8b5fa1\", \"id\": \"e15\", \"assessment_id\": \"ev_db6daa1d978979756c9a81ed\", \"fragments\": [{\"source_role\": \"user\", \"source_message_indices\": [40, 41], \"premise_group_ids\": [\"prem_c34cc028aa58bdc71b596e60\", \"prem_557380a823b71cb9aa5730a8\"], \"source_alias\": \"s44\", \"id\": \"src_cdbcccf5a7334b6a4f8c271d\", \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:2cb1946568c5490c5a3ee4bdb9c2a51d2485f16543f002ab190bad74ea8b5fa1\", \"start\": 105, \"end\": 430, \"exact_quote\": \"User: I explored audio production techniques, but it just didn’t resonate with me, and I found myself tangled in technical details rather than embracing the creativity. I realized that while understanding the mechanics of sound is important, my true passion seems to lie more in experiencing music rather than dissecting it. \", \"raw_text_hash\": \"97a13cbc5bfeff771ff3594db7911e39465543994e7a3a76cae81fe0c4c4b6fd\", \"event_time\": null}], \"node_ids\": [\"user_creative_history\"], \"raw_text_hash\": \"97a13cbc5bfeff771ff3594db7911e39465543994e7a3a76cae81fe0c4c4b6fd\", \"source_role\": \"user\", \"source_message_indices\": [40, 41], \"premise_group_ids\": [\"prem_557380a823b71cb9aa5730a8\", \"prem_c34cc028aa58bdc71b596e60\"], \"time_fragments\": [], \"start\": 105, \"end\": 430, \"exact_quote\": \"User: I explored audio production techniques, but it just didn’t resonate with me, and I found myself tangled in technical details rather than embracing the creativity. I realized that while understanding the mechanics of sound is important, my true passion seems to lie more in experiencing music rather than dissecting it. \"}, {\"node_id\": \"user_creative_history\", \"kind\": \"explicit\", \"stance\": \"support\", \"claim\": \"The user values deep engagement with music and personal creation over passive consumption.\", \"entity_scope\": \"user\", \"event_time\": null, \"reason\": \"The user expresses that true connection with music comes from deeper engagement and personal creation, indicating a creative inclination.\", \"source_ids\": [\"src_0996d286f96bbe0471d6734e\"], \"time_source_ids\": [], \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:e7a026a1e699694225904ac735e54f242d28ca85da0c2e3ea86daf04d7e3237a\", \"id\": \"e2\", \"assessment_id\": \"ev_5cdce903790d655a492bfde0\", \"fragments\": [{\"source_role\": \"user\", \"source_message_indices\": [43], \"premise_group_ids\": [\"prem_beb50f8a0c45e9f665161906\", \"prem_a03376bf3e3dde640c92da78\"], \"source_alias\": \"s4\", \"id\": \"src_0996d286f96bbe0471d6734e\", \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:e7a026a1e699694225904ac735e54f242d28ca85da0c2e3ea86daf04d7e3237a\", \"start\": 478, \"end\": 845, \"exact_quote\": \"The disappointment lingered as I thought about the many documentaries that delve into the creative journeys of musicians, revealing not just their triumphs but also their struggles and failures. It made me realize that true connection with music often comes from a deeper engagement, one that can be achieved through personal creation rather than passive consumption.\", \"raw_text_hash\": \"0273aee06a4f88db3e70585717f79f993f879589f854ee93d87eda70c828e9de\", \"event_time\": null}], \"node_ids\": [\"user_creative_history\"], \"raw_text_hash\": \"0273aee06a4f88db3e70585717f79f993f879589f854ee93d87eda70c828e9de\", \"source_role\": \"user\", \"source_message_indices\": [43], \"premise_group_ids\": [\"prem_a03376bf3e3dde640c92da78\", \"prem_beb50f8a0c45e9f665161906\"], \"time_fragments\": [], \"start\": 478, \"end\": 845, \"exact_quote\": \"The disappointment lingered as I thought about the many documentaries that delve into the creative journeys of musicians, revealing not just their triumphs but also their struggles and failures. It made me realize that true connection with music often comes from a deeper engagement, one that can be achieved through personal creation rather than passive consumption.\"}, {\"node_id\": \"user_creative_history\", \"kind\": \"explicit\", \"stance\": \"support\", \"claim\": \"The user is excited about an audio production course to deepen technical knowledge in mixing and mastering, aiming to bring creative vision to life.\", \"entity_scope\": \"user\", \"event_time\": null, \"reason\": \"The user describes their current enrollment and enthusiasm for the audio production course, showing ongoing creative engagement.\", \"source_ids\": [\"src_6a4496988a629d6293e327ba\"], \"time_source_ids\": [], \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:2e3781c45289036c9cb65ab4a01320b0762e67e335720ff5459ae18689577ee9\", \"id\": \"e4\", \"assessment_id\": \"ev_5e975b581e417ae6650ceea8\", \"fragments\": [{\"source_role\": \"user\", \"source_message_indices\": [70, 71], \"premise_group_ids\": [\"prem_4a9afeb29f2a22fcecb2b727\", \"prem_e04e2e80825e72deb447b250\", \"prem_867debed04cd06f0280acb78\", \"prem_0a08d847b672836893ab29de\"], \"source_alias\": \"s13\", \"id\": \"src_6a4496988a629d6293e327ba\", \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:2e3781c45289036c9cb65ab4a01320b0762e67e335720ff5459ae18689577ee9\", \"start\": 388, \"end\": 780, \"exact_quote\": \"I’m excited about the audio production course because it promises to deepen my technical knowledge and skills, especially in mixing and mastering. This new set of skills will allow me to bring my creative vision to life in ways I never thought possible. I truly believe that this journey will not only elevate my music but also connect me more deeply with the traditions I'm learning about.\\n\\n\", \"raw_text_hash\": \"30268a8fff528709c537f62907a4af2495488fddbd24b131fb7ad281f4741fcc\", \"event_time\": null}], \"node_ids\": [\"user_creative_history\"], \"raw_text_hash\": \"30268a8fff528709c537f62907a4af2495488fddbd24b131fb7ad281f4741fcc\", \"source_role\": \"user\", \"source_message_indices\": [70, 71], \"premise_group_ids\": [\"prem_0a08d847b672836893ab29de\", \"prem_4a9afeb29f2a22fcecb2b727\", \"prem_867debed04cd06f0280acb78\", \"prem_e04e2e80825e72deb447b250\"], \"time_fragments\": [], \"start\": 388, \"end\": 780, \"exact_quote\": \"I’m excited about the audio production course because it promises to deepen my technical knowledge and skills, especially in mixing and mastering. This new set of skills will allow me to bring my creative vision to life in ways I never thought possible. I truly believe that this journey will not only elevate my music but also connect me more deeply with the traditions I'm learning about.\\n\\n\"}, {\"node_id\": \"user_creative_history\", \"kind\": \"explicit\", \"stance\": \"support\", \"claim\": \"The user is taking time off to redefine their artistic vision and ensure personal projects receive attention.\", \"entity_scope\": \"user\", \"event_time\": null, \"reason\": \"The user states they need to carve out space for their voice and that taking time off is about redefining artistic vision.\", \"source_ids\": [\"src_04f96f70cda7607f7a23ffd9\"], \"time_source_ids\": [], \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:6d150ad4c535a7d1e56c49b3ef96bb96c6ad1180a0c11c38c79fd844a3c7550b\", \"id\": \"e8\", \"assessment_id\": \"ev_ff7451a94bfc967e4dd9ca74\", \"fragments\": [{\"source_role\": \"user\", \"source_message_indices\": [173, 174], \"premise_group_ids\": [\"prem_92ece8e63c24f2d52b516ccf\", \"prem_dbd0b010cb0aff51462ec3b9\", \"prem_7075176cbd56a44aa1c31026\", \"prem_4208fb8f3340fe57178f643b\"], \"source_alias\": \"s24\", \"id\": \"src_04f96f70cda7607f7a23ffd9\", \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:6d150ad4c535a7d1e56c49b3ef96bb96c6ad1180a0c11c38c79fd844a3c7550b\", \"start\": 413, \"end\": 797, \"exact_quote\": \"However, as I delved deeper into my own musical identity, I realized that I need to carve out space for my voice to shine through in original compositions. Taking this time off is about redefining my artistic vision and ensuring that my personal projects receive the attention they deserve. Ultimately, I hope to return with fresh ideas and a clearer focus on who I am as an artist.\\n\\n\", 